  clock: 4  # d7ac
  nonce: d7ac  # d7ac
  message: "Dogfood tranche 05 facet (F85.A1 / anon-card-011): adds the second half of the inversion — display_label is not merely absent from Class B; it IS populated, but on Class C (1645 external_symbol + 1 file node), exactly the class the validator EXEMPTS and that ADR-0032 does NOT reserve the field for. 0/262 Class B (protocol_origin-populated) carry it. The display_label value on external symbols is the node id with the 0-0: span segment removed (e.g. python:re:0-0:compile:unresolved -> python:re:compile:unresolved) — a derived id-form, NOT a human-readable label (name='Path', qualified_name=None). Last-segment distribution: unresolved 1312, attribute 214, doc_link 106, module 11, script 1, package 1. The validator's one-sided contrapositive check ('no display_label on Class A') would NOT catch this misdirected Class-C population. Evidence: frozen substrate.json. Blind severity 3/5, reproduced on frozen substrate."  # d7ac
